in 28 years."

00:01:25.267 --> 00:01:27.801
-That's a good name.
-No, he's real.

00:01:27.801 --> 00:01:30.100
Listen,
I was thinking about this.

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:35.234
I was, like -- Yo, I had to fill
out an emergency-contact form,

00:01:35.234 --> 00:01:36.367
