00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:17.734
"Stunning."

00:02:17.734 --> 00:02:19.167
"Gorgeous."

00:02:19.167 --> 00:02:21.267
"Hot mama."

00:02:21.267 --> 00:02:23.234
"Love your look."

00:02:23.234 --> 00:02:25.467
"Killin' it."

00:02:25.467 --> 00:02:28.801
"I am screaming."

00:02:28.801 --> 00:02:30.267
"Breathtaking."

00:02:30.267 --> 00:02:33.200
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.
-Breathtaking.

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:34.634
-Breathtaking.
That's right, yeah.

00:02:34.634 --> 00:02:36.701
