00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:50.067
No, I would never --
I would never block you.

00:02:50.067 --> 00:02:52.367
-Do you cry?

00:02:52.367 --> 00:02:54.334
Do you go to therapy? Honestly.

00:02:54.334 --> 00:02:55.968
-What's going on?
Do I go to therapy?

00:02:55.968 --> 00:02:57.067
-Yeah.

00:02:57.067 --> 00:02:58.100
-No, I don't go to ther--
I don't.

00:02:58.100 --> 00:02:59.901
-Neither do -- See --
